    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The sum of the first n natural numbers can also be written as follows:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "java",
      "content": "total = n + (n - 1) + (n - 2) + . . . + 3 + 2 + 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "We will take n as an argument. With each method call, we'll decrement n by one until we reach 1."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Base Case"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "If n equals 1, the sum is 1. This will be our base condition."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "java",
      "content": "if (n == 1) {\n    return 1;\n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Let's put this in our code."
